 "summary": "Grepping Tau Ceti and Mathlib found no existing extension, dual restriction, nested-open extension, universal-open equivalence or support-controlled localization for native bundle tests, and Mathlib has no `T2Space (EuclideanHalfSpace n)` instance (its `Instances/Real.lean` gives only `Zero`, `Inhabited` and path-connectedness instances). The PR reuses `extendByZero`, `restrictLinearMap`, `restrict_extendByZero`/`extendByZero_restrict`, `instTopologicalSpace_eq_compactlySupportedTopology` and `precompCompactConvergenceCLM`, and both nested-open and universal-open maps go through `localizeCLM`, so no continuity proof is duplicated.",
